<title>UK: LONDON SILVER FIXES BARELY CHANGED, QUIET.</title>
<headline>LONDON SILVER FIXES BARELY CHANGED, QUIET.</headline>
<text>
<p>SILVER - Fixed at 432.50 cents vs 434.00 cents previously. Quiet, bearish after attempt to fill chart gap failed. Forecast for dip before Friday's Comex option expiry.</p>
<p>GOLD - Steady so far at lower level. $318.50/$319.00, down a dollar.</p>
<p>PLATINUM - Down $12.50 at $425.00/$428.00.</p>
<p>PALLADIUM - Off $11.00 at $217.00/$220.00.</p>
</text>
